 "emoji": "🐧",
 "sentences": [
  "Emperor penguins dive to 535 meters deep.",
  "They are the tallest and heaviest of all living penguin species.",
  "These flightless birds have wings stiffened into flippers for swimming.",
  "Their diet includes fish, krill, and squid.",
  "They possess solid bones to reduce pressure injuries while hunting.",
  "To survive, they can even shut down non-essential organ functions.",
  "They are the only penguin species breeding during the Antarctic winter."
